<WorldInfo id='n1' docUrl='https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/worldinfo' info='"North Wharf warehouse fire. Six agencies fly one UAV each in a search line" "that circles the site. Each ground station sees only its own UAV. By radio" "they agree where the charging robot should be, and it drives there, because" "that place moves with the UAVs. Orange dots are its recent ground track."' title="North Wharf warehouse fire"></WorldInfo>
